      "reviews": "“This is pure escapism, an opportunity to pop on some headphones and be transported into the outback for a short while.”<br>Kotaku<br><br>“In an exhibition hall filled with a cacophony of gun sound effects and the whirr of futuristic paraphernalia from other games, Paperbark cuts through the noise with its calm.”<br>Mashable<br><br>“Paperbark Is The Most Aussie Game You’ll Ever Play”<br>Press Start<br>",
